sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub (main)
    participant ADO as Azure DevOps Pipeline
    participant PT as agents-cli eval (generate+grade)
    participant VJ as Vertex Eval Service (optional)
    participant GCS as GCS (raw/ + results/)

    Dev->>GH: Merge PR (agent code and/or eval sets)
    GH->>ADO: CI trigger via GitHub App connection<br/>(path filter: agents/my_agent/**)
    ADO->>ADO: Checkout @ SHA, install pinned agents-cli + google-adk 2.x
    ADO->>PT: eval generate → eval grade per tier
    loop each tests/eval/datasets/{fast-*,judged-*}.json
        PT->>PT: generate responses, grade vs eval_config metrics
        opt judged-* datasets (judge metrics in eval_config.judged.yaml)
            PT->>VJ: judge calls (ADC / GCP creds)
            VJ-->>PT: scores + rationale
        end
        PT->>PT: gate: grade exit/threshold (spike) or pytest assertion fallback
    end
    PT-->>ADO: grade_results/ + JUnit XML (one result per dataset)
    ADO->>ADO: PublishTestResults@2 → Tests tab
    ADO->>GCS: write results/{agent}/{SHA}/{run}/... (scores, invocations: responses/tool calls, tokens, rationale)
    ADO->>ADO: (same pipeline) build Runner Service image tagged @ SHA
    ADO-->>Dev: Pass/fail + per-dataset results in ADO UI
